\newlabel{fig:Pauli_x_gate_params_1_negative_delta}{{5.2}{30}{Time dependent parameters for time evolution of the switching of Majoranas 2 and 3 as shown in Figure \ref {fig:Pauli-X_gate}. The whole T-junction has $\omega = 1$. The horizontal arms have $\Delta = 1$, whereas the vertical arm has $\Delta = -1$. $\mu $ is defined by equation \ref {eq:mu(tau)_Pauli_x}, using $\mu _\text {triv} = 8$, $\mu _\text {topo} = 0.05$}{figure.caption.19}{}}
